      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.032 (up from ₹0.27 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹18.7m (up 9.6% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.68m (up ₹16.0m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.0% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was primarily driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 30% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 54% per year, which means it is performing significantly worse than earnings.",
